'''Lucky Sloth''' (福の神, ''Fuku no Kami'', '''God of Fortune''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 2.1 Update#Version 2.1.2 Update|Version 2.1.2]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

