==Enemy==
Lucky Sloth is essentially [[THE SLOTH]] with 100 less range, a much faster attack rate, and a 20% chance to knockback your units, making it a lot more threatening and inconvenient to deal with.

==Strategy==
Because of its reduced range, you can use units like Dragon Cat against it. However, don't use close-ranged units since, unlike most of its variants, Lucky Sloth attacks quickly. You can also use rushers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] to quickly dispose of it.

